### Base URL Variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root Discovery & Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Readiness Probe (DB & Cache Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
Accept: application/json

### 4. API Version & Checksum Manifests
GET {{baseUrl}}/version
Accept: application/json

### 5. List All 114 Surahs
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/surahs
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Surah Details (Surah Al-Fatihah, ID: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/surahs/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Paginated Ayahs of a Surah
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/surahs/1/ayahs?page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Ayah by Reference (Ayat Al-Kursi, 2:255)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/ayahs/2:255
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Random Ayah
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/ayahs/random
Accept: application/json

### 10. Arabic Text Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/search?q=الصلاة&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 11. List All 30 Juz
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/juz
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Ayahs of Juz 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/juz/1
Accept: application/json

### 13. Get Ayahs on Madinah Mushaf Page 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/pages/1
Accept: application/json

### 14. List Adhkar Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/adhkar/categories
Accept: application/json

### 15. Get Morning Adhkar
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/adhkar/category/morning
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Quranic and Prophetic Duas
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/adhkar/duas
Accept: application/json

### 17. Get Al-Muyassar Tafsir (1:1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tafsir/1/1
Accept: application/json

### 18. Get Saheeh International English Translation (1:1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/translations/1/1?lang=en
Accept: application/json

### 19. List Verified Audio Reciters
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reciters
Accept: application/json
